<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><title>Resumo Diário</title>
<style>body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.6;color:#333;background:#f4f4f4;margin:0;padding:0}.container{max-width:600px;margin:20px auto;background:#fff;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.header{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0066CC,#004D99);color:#fff;padding:30px;text-align:center}.content{padding:30px}.button{display:inline-block;background:#0066CC;color:#fff!important;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 30px;border-radius:6px;margin:10px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:14px}.footer{background:#f8f9fa;padding:20px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#666}.footer a{color:#0066CC;text-decoration:none}.stats-box{display:flex;justify-content:space-around;margin:20px 0}.stat-item{text-align:center;padding:15px}.stat-number{font-size:32px;font-weight:bold;color:#0066CC}.stat-label{font-size:12px;color:#666;margin-top:5px}.complaint-item{border-left:4px solid #0066CC;padding:15px;margin:10px 0;background:#f8f9fa;border-radius:4px}</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
<div class="header"><h1>📊 Resumo Diário</h1></div>
<div class="content">
<h2>Olá, {{userName}}!</h2>
<p>Aqui está o resumo das atividades de <strong>{{date}}</strong>.</p>
<div class="stats-box">
<div class="stat-item">
<div class="stat-number">{{newComplaints}}</div>
<div class="stat-label">Novas Denúncias</div>
</div>
<div class="stat-item">
<div class="stat-number">{{updatedComplaints}}</div>
<div class="stat-label">Atualizadas</div>
</div>
<div class="stat-item">
<div class="stat-number">{{pendingActions}}</div>
<div class="stat-label">Ações Pendentes</div>
</div>
</div>
<h3 style="margin-top:30px">Denúncias Recentes:</h3>
{{#each complaints}}
<div class="complaint-item">
<p style="margin:0;font-weight:bold">{{this.protocol}} - {{this.title}}</p>
<p style="margin:5px 0 10px 0;font-size:14px;color:#666">Status: {{this.status}}</p>
<a href="{{this.url}}" class="button" style="padding:8px 20px;font-size:12px">Ver Detalhes</a>
</div>
{{/each}}
<center style="margin-top:30px">
<a href="{{appUrl}}/complaints" class="button">Ver Todas as Denúncias</a>
</center>
</div>
<div class="footer">
<p><strong>{{appName}}</strong></p>
<p><a href="{{appUrl}}">Acessar Sistema</a> | <a href="{{appUrl}}/preferences">Gerenciar Preferências</a> | <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}">Suporte</a></p>
<p>&copy; {{year}} {{appName}}.</p>
</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
